Modifications (2026): separate liquidglass namespace; new glass stylesheet
and local appearance controller; native accessible login form; reduced
motion and keyboard menu handling; standalone package registration and
uninstall fallback. Text uses operating-system fonts. The inherited Argon
icon font and compatibility assets remain in use.

No router credentials, network settings, background photographs, or account
data are contained in the package or source release.
